  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Poverty Reduction Sector Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Sectorial Reduccin de Pobreza</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sectorial loan program in two tranches of US$15 millions each. The Program has three components: (i) institute at the highest levels the culture of planning based on results and monitor the projects seeking for intermediate goals; (ii) establish the mechanism for a continuous definition and evaluation of priority programs related with the PRSP; and (iii) solve key problems in management and supervision.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
